---
# SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
#
# doc/codingguide.txt (Jan 2001) never set a formatting style, and the
# existing tree carries none consistently -- SPEC.md's own diagnosis.
# This config is for new and touched code going forward, not a mandate to
# reformat 26 years of unstyled history (AGENTS.md: no cosmetic churn
# riding along with a behavior change). `format-check` (CMakeLists.txt)
# runs it over tests/**, the one part of the tree this phase actually
# wrote to a single, consistent style; widen its file list only as more
# of the tree is deliberately touched and reformatted on its own commit.
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 80
AccessModifierOffset: -2
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Right
SortIncludes: false
